# deploy/relay/.trivyignore
#
# The ONLY sanctioned way to waive a finding from the relay-container.yml
# vulnerability scan (trivy, exit-code 1 on HIGH/CRITICAL). Format: one CVE
# id per line. Every entry MUST be preceded by a comment stating:
#   - why the finding does not apply to this image (the final stage is
#     distroless static: one Go binary, no shell, no package manager,
#     no libc to pivot on), and
#   - an expiry date at which the waiver is re-reviewed and either
#     re-justified or removed.
# An empty file waives nothing. Deleting this file breaks the workflow on
# purpose: the ignore mechanism must stay discoverable and documented.
